길티기어 굿즈
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img alt="후드티와 열혈백이 탐난다" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/8/4/0efda70e693d4772-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;
후드티와 열혈백이 탐난다
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img alt="키링" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/8/4/792e91e38cd94fae-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;
키링
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img alt="버블보블 머그컵과 미니 봉제인형" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/8/4/5d9323d7e6fe4fa0-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;
버블보블 머그컵과 미니 봉제인형
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img alt="달력과 장패드" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/8/4/c5a6e2aa50a441a8-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
