달력과 장패드
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;img alt="길티기어 키캡" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/8/4/bc829a6de80b48f9-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
