&lt;span&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/dIe5DD/btsI5gZFGXP/qbz2rsEvGhoIY9NobygAGK/img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Like a Dragon Infinite Wealth logo image&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_main_title&quot;&gt;공략 리스트로 돌아가기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_sub_title&quot;&gt; - 용과 같이 8&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;/3454&quot;&gt;
&lt;span&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/bqo9YR/btsJz3s0JvR/CBmfakz0f8WuGLUf9kMG50/img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;직업과 극기 - 딜리버리 헬프 타이틀 이미지&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_main_title&quot;&gt;직업과 극기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_sub_title&quot;&gt; - 딜리버리 헬프&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;/3455&quot;&gt;
&lt;span&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/VWRC6/btsJBoP6gTc/zblUJzYR3FKPFdzrOOGQoK/img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;직업과 극기 - 기술 계승 유대기 타이틀 이미지&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_main_title&quot;&gt;직업과 극기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_sub_title&quot;&gt; - 기술 계승 &amp;amp; 유대기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;/3456&quot;&gt;
&lt;span&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cTIK2V/btsJBRxAYvM/qrqkIcL7fsjmnDKKOcfAg0/img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;직업과 극기 - 직업 개방 조건(능력치 비교) 타이틀 이미지&quot;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_main_title&quot;&gt;직업과 극기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;list_sub_title&quot;&gt; - 직업 개방 조건(+능력치 비교)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
