&lt;div class=&quot;sub_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;경품 교환 위치&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- ※제8장에서 체크한 기준&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;table_box&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;imageblock alignCenter&quot; data-ke-mobileStyle=&quot;widthOrigin&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;368&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-url=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOmdVg/btsI81WwhdM/zfwGJKqcl1uqr1grlleNh0/img.jpg&quot; data-phocus=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOmdVg/btsI81WwhdM/zfwGJKqcl1uqr1grlleNh0/img.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOmdVg/btsI81WwhdM/zfwGJKqcl1uqr1grlleNh0/img.jpg&quot; srcset=&quot;https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdn%2FbOmdVg%2FbtsI81WwhdM%2FzfwGJKqcl1uqr1grlleNh0%2Fimg.jpg&quot; onerror=&quot;this.onerror=null; this.src='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png'; this.srcset='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png';&quot; alt=&quot;경품 교환 이진쵸 북부 이미지&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;368&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;368&quot;/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;imageblock alignCenter&quot; data-ke-mobileStyle=&quot;widthOrigin&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;621&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-url=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cQq77M/btsJaeNSpHg/kkarWfim7jZg7zQZuhaMD0/img.jpg&quot; data-phocus=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cQq77M/btsJaeNSpHg/kkarWfim7jZg7zQZuhaMD0/img.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cQq77M/btsJaeNSpHg/kkarWfim7jZg7zQZuhaMD0/img.jpg&quot; srcset=&quot;https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdn%2FcQq77M%2FbtsJaeNSpHg%2FkkarWfim7jZg7zQZuhaMD0%2Fimg.jpg&quot; onerror=&quot;this.onerror=null; this.src='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png'; this.srcset='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png';&quot; alt=&quot;경품 교환 이진쵸 남부 이미지&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;621&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;621&quot;/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&quot;imageblock alignCenter&quot; data-ke-mobileStyle=&quot;widthOrigin&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;781&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-url=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cfkS2u/btsJaqgieyT/g04yJqYRDMQNzi5H5lWhl1/img.jpg&quot; data-phocus=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cfkS2u/btsJaqgieyT/g04yJqYRDMQNzi5H5lWhl1/img.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/cfkS2u/btsJaqgieyT/g04yJqYRDMQNzi5H5lWhl1/img.jpg&quot; srcset=&quot;https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=https%3A%2F%2Fblog.kakaocdn.net%2Fdn%2FcfkS2u%2FbtsJaqgieyT%2Fg04yJqYRDMQNzi5H5lWhl1%2Fimg.jpg&quot; onerror=&quot;this.onerror=null; this.src='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png'; this.srcset='//t1.daumcdn.net/tistory_admin/static/images/no-image-v1.png';&quot; alt=&quot;경품 교환 카무로쵸 이미지&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;781&quot; data-origin-width=&quot;700&quot; data-origin-height=&quot;781&quot;/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sub_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;[1]서바이벌 캔 줍기&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- ※단위는 캔 줍기 포인트&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;table_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;현금&lt;/b&gt; : 10엔(50pts) / 100엔(500pts) / 500엔(2500pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;기타(환금)&lt;/b&gt; : 포켓 티슈(50pts) / 고물 전자레인지(150pts) / 고물 TV(200pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;무기&lt;/b&gt; : 극약 버블 밀대(1,000,000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;음식(주류)&lt;/b&gt; : 가라아게 도시락(900pts) / 고급 불고기 도시락(1300pts) / 일본주(병)(1000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;소재&lt;/b&gt; : 강화 강철(중)(8000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;성장&lt;/b&gt; : 레벨 어퍼(32000pts) ※1개 한정 / 피지컬 어퍼(32000pts) / 가드 어퍼(32000pts) / 노숙자의 극의(24000pts) / 작은 마담의 극의(24000pts) / 요리의 극의(24000pts) / 뒷세계의 극의(24000pts) / 호스트의 극의(24000pts) / 여왕의 극의(24000pts) / 비전서 심(20000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;MUSIC&lt;/b&gt; : 사운드트랙 CD [진 여신전생5] 1(600pts) / 사운드트랙 CD [진 여신전생5] 2(600pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sub_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;[2]길거리 장기&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- ※단위는 장기 점수. 하와이와 공유&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;table_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;무기&lt;/b&gt; : ★5 서부의 총잡이의 리볼버(21000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;소재&lt;/b&gt; : 강화 강철(하)(850pts) / 강화 강철(중)(1700pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;기타&lt;/b&gt; : 술과 싸움과 남자와 장기(650pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;성장&lt;/b&gt; : 레벨 어퍼(7000pts) ※1개 한정 / 멘탈 어퍼(7000pts) / 가드 어퍼(70000pts) / 용사의 극의(5000pts) / 노숙자의 극의(5000pts) / 형사의 극의(5000pts) / 히트맨의 극의(5000pts) / 요리의 극의(5000pts) / 댄스의 극의(5000pts) / 프로페서 뮤턴트(2100pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;DIY&lt;/b&gt; : 택시의 설계도(1000pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;MUSIC&lt;/b&gt; : 사운드트랙 CD [소울 해커즈2] 1(150pts) / 사운드트랙 CD [소울 해커즈2] 2(150pts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sub_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;[3]도박장&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- ※단위는 목패. 목패는 구입 가능(1점당 &amp;yen;100). 하와이와 공유&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;table_box&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;환금&lt;/b&gt; : 동 접시(10점) / 은 접시(100점) / 금 접시(500점) / 백금 접시(1000점) / 이탈리아제 고급 반지(1500점) / 스위스제 고급 손목시계(2000점)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;주류(기타)&lt;/b&gt; : 고급 일본주 '니지노하시'(180점) / 선물용 담배 세트(20점)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;무기&lt;/b&gt; : ★3 모조 핸드(456점) / ★5 주사위 지팡이(33988점)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;DIY&lt;/b&gt; : 묶인 고양이 동상의 설계도(2000점)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;MUSIC&lt;/b&gt; : 사운드트랙 CD [페르소나3P] 1(30점) / 사운드트랙 CD [페르소나3P] 2(30점)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;in_ad&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- (수동) PC 표준 본문 반응형 --&gt; &lt;ins class=&quot;adsbygoogle&quot; style=&quot;display: block&quot; data-ad-client=&quot;ca-pub-2180001913232530&quot; data-ad-slot=&quot;8050216341&quot; data-ad-format=&quot;horizontal&quot; data-full-width-responsive=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/ins&gt; 
